BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 118.02 Tm (assumption is that every document goes public eventually.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 102.80 Tm (On the data side, the consensus is that MAUDE is free, public, and badly) Tj ET
